                               '(list_customers, create_customer). Finalizing and sending are separate '
                               'functions, called only after explicit human validation. Each line takes '
                               'exactly one of two shapes, with no other key (any deviation is refused as '
                               'NotAnyOf): a product line {product_id, quantity}, the product filling the '
